--- !u!114 &1918729063
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1918729059}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 770d21d35967f4574b167ed254640909, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  countdown: {fileID: 2036154898}
  ani: {fileID: 1918729064}
  d1:
  - Greetings <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. Headquarters has recently put you
    onto a <color=#FB7878>new mission</color>.
  - As you may have heard, we have recently been in a covert interagency skirmish
    against the <color=#FB7878>Evil spy agency</color>, also known as the <color=#FB7878>ESA</color>.
  - <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> has placed <color=#FB7878>explosive barrels</color>
    all around this neighborhood park in the hopes of yknow... exploding the park.
  - Locate the barrels and <color=#FB7878>blow them up</color> using your dynamite.
  - Headquarters also told me to tell you the following message...
  - '"Use <color=#FB7878>WASD</color> to move and <color=#FB7878>LEFT CLICK</color>
    to throw dynamite."'
  - ...whatever that means...
  - Anyways, I'll inform you if I get any more updates.
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  f1: 000000000000000003000000010000000000000004000000020000000000000000000000
  d2:
  - 'Listen up <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>, I just recieved an update from headquarters. '
  - Apparently <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> spies have hacked into our central communications
    dataframe and are trying to send <color=#FB7878>fake messages</color> to you.
  - I need you to <color=#FB7878>keep an eye out</color> for any message which <color=#FB7878>appears
    unusual</color>.
  - If you think that the message is fake, <color=#FB7878>ignore what you are being
    told to do</color>.
  - Also, thanks to your good work, our department has recieved more funding, so
    your <color=#FB7878>movement speed</color> has been <color=#FB7878>increased</color>.
  - Oh... by the way make sure to destroy any <color=#FB7878>traffic cones</color>
    that you see.
  - I got a note from headquarters saying that <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> has hidden
    <color=#FB7878>mini explosive barrels</color> inside of them.
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  f2: 0000000003000000000000000100000009000000000000000400000000000000
  d3:
  - m3kx9n gp 7hzo z2j3q <color=#FB7878>z6t22u5h27</color>. 3xg2ct8n05h27 e8 z6y
    6p6ee.
  - k3jx7bpq2k q9wp5j 8h3h Fx t5nqq 8ktz3 pk3vjq6t <color=#FB7878>6q6 t 2p6z2p</color>.
  - adaj43 sd3ha5df as87 43sad7 fds c9 sdj42 <color=#FB7878>av3fh 8sj34h</color>.
  - z2p 7k3ha8 3o5tz6ct2h 4p6ct7z 6t2t7...
  - 2fjx0x pz 4h3qt, x9wt vy 7q3o mkx7z8zqx x7 <color=#FB7878>destroy garbage cans</color>
    5zqx z2t6z.
  - n8kk 6uh8 <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. Y8t v2hzt v6qk7 5j 8k7ct5nq k7 z6h.
  f3: 060000000700000008000000060000000700000008000000
  d4:
  - Salutations <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>, I see youre doing quite well.
  - Things have been pretty <color=#FB7878>chaotic</color> here over at the headquarters
    ever since <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> hacked our online dataframe.
  - I fear that the <color=#FB7878>fake messages</color> that they are sending you
    will get <color=#FB7878>harder to spot</color> as time goes on.
  - However, in the process of being hacked, we got ahold of some of their <color=#FB7878>Secret
    files</color>.
  - Apparently <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> has embedded <color=#FB7878>explosive barrels</color>
    inside of the <color=#FB7878>signs</color> scattered around the park, so we need
    you to <color=#FB7878>blow them up</color>.
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  f4: 000000000300000001000000090000000000000000000000
  d5:
  - Greetings <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>.
  - <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> has continued their attacks against us and i have
    been instructed by <color=#FB7878>headquarters</color> to tell you the following...
  - '"Due to some work by our servaillance team, we have discovered that the <color=#FB7878>soccer
    balls</color> around the park are constructed of <color=#FB7878>explosive barrels</color>..."'
  - '"...Use your dynamite to <color=#FB7878>destroy the soccer balls</color> immediately."'
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  f5: 0b0000000c0000000d0000000d0000000b000000
  d6:
  - Pay attention <color=#59AFF3>Agent C4</color>, this message is important.
  - First off, due to the ongoing cyberattacks commited by <color=#59AFF3>ESA</color>
    as well as the importance of your mission, you have recieved a <color=#59AFF3>reload
    speed increase</color>
  - 'We hope this will make your efforts against <color=#59AFF3>ESA</color> quicker
    and more effective. '
  - Secondly, headquarters has sent me <color=#59AFF3>another letter</color> informing
    us of what we should <color=#59AFF3>destroy</color>. Heres what it says...
  - '"After recent review, our top scientists have discovered that the <color=#59AFF3>balloons</color>
    inside the park are actually <color=#59AFF3>exploding barrels</color>. Destroy
    them <color=#59AFF3>immediately</color>."'
  - Good luck <color=#59AFF3>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  d7:
  - Listen up <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>, I dont have a lot of time.
  - <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> has found the location of our headquarters and is
    stealing more <color=#FB7878>classified information</color> as we speak.
  - I need you to <color=#FB7878>destroy all the benches</color> in the park. Apparently
    theyre made out of <color=#FB7878>Explsovie barrels</color>.
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  d8:
  - Greetings <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>.
  - This is <color=#FB7878>urgent</color>. I need you to <color=#FB7878>destroy all
    the bushes</color> as fast as possible, no questions asked.
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  d9:
  - 'Lock in <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. '
  - <color=#FB7878>ESA</color> managed to get their hands on the information regarding
    your <color=#FB7878>Current Mission</color>.
  - You have <color=#FB7878>2 minutes</color> left before you need to evacuate, so
    ive increased your <color=#FB7878>movement speed</color> and <color=#FB7878>reload
    speed</color>.
  - <color=#FB7878>Destroy everything you can before those 2 minutes run out</color>
  - Good luck <color=#FB7878>Agent C4</color>. The whole world is counting on you.
  f6: 000000000300000000000000000000000400000000000000
  f7: 00000000030000000100000000000000
  f8: 000000000100000000000000
  f9: 0000000003000000000000000100000000000000
